.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Helper routines for general and parallel I/O\&. 

This file provides various sets of functions related to write and read data as well es to encode and decode it to certain formats\&.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
To abstract transparent writing/reading into/from files or buffers, we provide functions centered around \fBsc_io_sink_new\fP and \fBsc_io_source_new\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
To abstract parallel file I/O in a way that works both with and without MPI support, we provide \fBsc_io_open\fP, \fBsc_io_write\fP and friends\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
To write to the VTK binary compressed format, we provide suitable functions to base64 encode and zlib-compress as required; see \fBsc_vtk_write_binary\fP and \fBsc_vtk_write_compressed\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
To support self-contained ASCII-armored compression, we provide the functions \fBsc_io_encode\fP, \fBsc_io_decode_info\fP and \fBsc_io_decode\fP\&. They losslessly transform a block of arbitrary data into a compressed and base64-encoded format and back that is unambiguously defined and human-friendly\&. 
.PP

